      <rules>
        <rule id="b5f7-9730-477f-5be7" name="The Lodge" hidden="false">
          <description>- May include THE LODGE Characters and Assets and perform the UNDER HUNGRY BOUGHS Black Diablerie. - When a friendly MORTAL character dies within 8” of a friendly WITCH character, that WITCH gains a permanent +1 POWER (to a maximum bonus of +3 Power from this rule).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
